  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It's possible to drop a Group+ portal in seemingly any instance type, even if you're not the one who created that instance.\n\nThis is inconsistent with how Friends+ works, it will prevent you from dropping a Friends+ portal that you didn't create the instance for.\n\nAdditionally, this inconsistency can lead to a lot of problems regarding privacy and consent, as Group+ is also considered a private instance per VRChat's Community Guidelines and allows content and activities that would otherwise be disallowed.\n\nIt's unreasonable and unrealistic to expect users quickly entering a portal to read the group rules in the brief moment that portal exists to know what they might be getting into.",
